  "scope": "An actual fixed 128-instruction program reads both stored demand endpoint words, executes the real padded comparison, and either allocates the true diagonal result or reads the actual original adjacency matrix at both decoded indices. It preserves the original demand and matrix and refines the original diagonal-or-direct-edge predicate. The same physical run includes final halt, bounded by original label and matrix-cell lengths. Valid represented endpoint indices and initial address widths remain explicit; ordered first-invalid-demand traversal and complete dispatch are separate.",
